{
  "_about": "Light theme tokens for the keyboard clone. Roles, not brand: replica-brand swaps values later. Dark values live in tokens.dark.json with identical role names. Check both with contrast.py. All values are our own design choices, not measurements of the original (no screenshots were available).",
